Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:22.27,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:24.40,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:28.82,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:35.07,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Shoot a thread of light
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:45.00,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}itami o norikoeru tabi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:54.72,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kokoro wa eiri ni togisumasareru (Never give up)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:02:03.06,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kurikaesareru shukumei no saihate de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:06.86,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}hikari chiru umi ni chikau
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.53,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Getting through
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:11.65,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ikiru imi o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:17.24,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sekai ni nokosu kara
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.99,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Heaven’s falling down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.29,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sora otoshite mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:26.96,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}nozomi o kudakou kyouki no kami no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.96,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.09,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:35.55,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:40.06,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}tomosu honoo ga
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:46.23,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}inochi no kirameki (Destiny will begin tonight)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:22.27,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:24.40,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:28.82,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:35.07,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je tirerai un fil de lumière
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:45.00,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Chaque fois que je surmonte la douleur
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:54.72,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Mon cœur devient plus affûté (N’abandonne jamais)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:02:03.06,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Au bout de ce destin sans fin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:06.86,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je fais le serment devant cette océan lumineux
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.53,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Que je tiendrai bon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:11.65,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si je tombe ici
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:17.24,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je lèguerai le sens de la vie
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.99,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le ciel s’effondre
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.29,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si le firmament me tombe dessus
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:26.96,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je briserai les desseins d’un dieu fou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.96,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.09,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:35.55,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:40.06,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}J’allume une flamme
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:46.23,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}L’étincelle de la vie (Le destin commencera ce soir)
